      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Just outside town, the Cumberland Mountain School stands as a limestone landmark, symbolizing early 20th‑century rural education on the plateau.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
