      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A bronze marker in downtown Crossville celebrates Mandy Barnett, the country‑music star who rose from this small town to the Grand Ole Opry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
